OL,3,GNEWSA'Saying no to sex once should have
OL,4,Abeen enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist who says she was raped by
OL,7,Fsomeone she knew when he pressured her
OL,8,Finto sex is hosting an exhibition to
OL,9,Fspark open conversations around
OL,10,Fconsent.
OL,12,FIt took Magdalena Boryn five years of
OL,13,Fblaming herself before someone pointed
OL,14,Fout that being coerced into sex could
OL,15,Fstill constitute rape.
OL,17,FShe has since channelled her "healing"
OL,18,Finto a series of paintings featuring
OL,19,Fanimals, on display at the Mazi Project
OL,20,Fin Bedminster, Bristol, from 19-20
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
